      "message": "feat(app): whole-model Adaptive 3D Pocket plans its stock ring from the air\n\nThe Adaptive plain ladder of a whole-model 3D Pocket now reaches\nstock_band(r, true) past the stock and calls pocket3d_open_prev with\nthe stock outline. Shell, rest and Multi-Axis Rough keep the old band.\nPinned by a_clamp_in_the_air_band_blocks_the_post: steel in the air\nband is struck and the post gate names it.\n\nRefs #1950\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
