        "date": "2026-11-15T22:18:30Z"
      },
      "message": "feat(motion): microlift joins for the air-side stock ring plan\n\nplan_from_air joins each pass to the one before it by the existing\nLinkLaw (straight chord, return over the retract plane, or a lead whose\ngraze joins the pass). Each join is walked again on the stock in pass\norder and its readings go into the worst load. A pass with no proved\njoin keeps its retract hop.\n\nD plate, R 5: hops 45 -> 3 (budget 8); worst load unchanged at\n0.153760. The stock-ring level test now asserts hops <= HOP_BUDGET.\n\nRefs #1950\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
